    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061129.0322\n\nBAGHDAD, Nov. 29 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nUrgent: Sadr bloc suspends role in government, parliament\n\n\n\n\nThe political bloc loyal to Iraqi Shiite cleric Muqtada al-Sadr Wednesday announced suspension of their role in the parliament and government to protest Iraqi prime minister's meeting with U.S. President George W. Bush.",
